    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Fighter is a tense round-based action game with rogue-lite elements, inspired by classic survival modes. </strong>You play as a young boy left home alone for the night, facing off against waves of strange nighttime creatures. Each wave gets tougher, each minute more intense. A unique mix of tension, stylized action, and childhood bravery creates a fast-paced fight for survival \u2014 can you make it until sunrise?</p>",
